    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      104.88,
      389.37,
      286.44,
      419.6
    ],
    "text": "My Ref. No.: GAL/LAN/AQUIS/A13/19. Land Ministry Ref. No.: 4-3/9/2013/WS/377.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.9994001388549805,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      424.39,
      286.43,
      503.32
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as Amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the land/Servitude described in the Schedule given below for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599039554595947,
      7.91920804977417,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      65.04,
      505.99,
      268.92,
      524.21
    ],
    "text": "Description of the Land/Servitude to be acquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.959303855895996,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      524.46,
      286.41,
      595.52
    ],
    "text": "Allotments of land in extent about 0.0569 Hectare depicted in Preliminary Plan No. Ke/3545 dated 30.05.2017 prepared by Surveyor General, situated in the villages of Weragoda in Subdivision of Beligal Korale in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Galigamuwa in the District of Kegalle in Sabaragamuwa Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      1.9198079109191895,
      4.079591751098633,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      318.72,
      334.15,
      397.8,
      344.23
    ],
    "text": "Dates for Inquires:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      346.63,
      539.66,
      405.2
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid Lands to be acquires are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in written, before me at the Divisional Secretariat, Galigamuwa on 19th July, 2017 at 10.00 a.m.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599039554595947,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      406.36,
      539.61,
      483.44
    ],
    "text": "And are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (with duplicate) on or before the 12th July, 2017, the nature of their interest in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.91920804977417,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
